                                "text": "A few more duets with Ghostface would have been illy, and even ONE track with RZA would have been the icing on a top notch cake. Regardless though to any who thought that Raekwon the Chef couldn't cook it up any more, \"The Lex Diamond Story\" proves that with or without RZA, he's still got it locked."
